      The anti-pattern in one line: <code>DRAWERS[step]</code> changes the element type, so React reconciles
      by teardown. Each of the three drawers also duplicates the header and footer internally, which means
      "make the buttons match across steps" is now a maintenance task instead of a guarantee.
    </CodeCaption>
